# Goal: diff prints a one-line working-tree modification.
> init
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "add f"
<<<
> tag base
<<<
+ f.txt notwug.txt
> diff
diff --gitlite a/f.txt b/f.txt
--- a/f.txt
+++ b/f.txt
@@ -1,1 +1,1 @@
-This is a wug.
+This is not a wug.
<<<
> diff base
diff --gitlite a/f.txt b/f.txt
--- a/f.txt
+++ b/f.txt
@@ -1,1 +1,1 @@
-This is a wug.
+This is not a wug.
<<<
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
f.txt (modified)

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
